  "bodyHtml": "<div data-w-id=\"0a17a875-e722-4b3c-b8b6-280462b7637a\" class=\"section loop\"><div data-w-id=\"0a17a875-e722-4b3c-b8b6-280462b7637b\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"looping-content-container\"><div class=\"looping-content-inner-container\"><h1 class=\"looping-heading\">Collaborate</h1><h1 class=\"looping-heading text-light-grey\">•</h1></div><div class=\"looping-content-inner-container\"><h1 class=\"looping-heading\">Collaborate</h1><h1 class=\"looping-heading text-light-grey\">•</h1></div><div class=\"looping-content-inner-container\"><h1 class=\"looping-heading\">Collaborate</h1><h1 class=\"looping-heading text-light-grey\">•</h1></div><div class=\"looping-content-inner-container\"><h1 class=\"looping-heading\">Collaborate</h1><h1 class=\"looping-heading text-light-grey\">•</h1></div></div></div><div class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid _12-column-grid\"><img src=\"/assets/img/640e40dc3ecaf8fe325521ae_9C41666A-3327-4395-AC0E-4A140D6B4918_1_105_c.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_67f14299-99d2-3bb1-2c82-25f6c1578d57-564b9120\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 768px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/img/640e40dc3ecaf8fe325521ae_9C41666A-3327-4395-AC0E-4A140D6B4918_1_105_c-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/img/640e40dc3ecaf8fe325521ae_9C41666A-3327-4395-AC0E-4A140D6B4918_1_105_c.avif 768w\" class=\"margin-top-4\"/><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec418-564b9120\" class=\"list-container\"><div class=\"list-item-container extended-padding-collab\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid list-item-grid\"><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec41f-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\">///</div><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec41d-564b9120\">Communication</div><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec421-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\"> </div><div id=\"w-node-_167304d6-03a1-50bf-cf7b-8a110ff3b765-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\">We discuss your demands, expectations, requirements, budget, time frames, and anything else you may need.</div></div></div><div class=\"list-item-container extended-padding-collab\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid list-item-grid\"><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec425-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\">///</div><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec429-564b9120\">UX research</div><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec42b-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\">I analyse user behaviours, uncover pain points, and conduct competitive audit to achieve your project goals.</div></div></div><div class=\"list-item-container extended-padding-collab\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid list-item-grid\"><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec42f-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\">///</div><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec433-564b9120\">Prototyping</div><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec435-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\">I prepare a compete prototype of your future website in Figma or Adobe XD, making everything clickable and animated. This will allow for any changes you would like to make before development.</div></div></div><div class=\"list-item-container extended-padding-collab\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid list-item-grid\"><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec439-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\">///</div><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec43d-564b9120\">Development</div><div id=\"w-node-_2ec6d681-9b1c-3ada-e7c1-ff0d815ec43f-564b9120\" class=\"text-extra-small\">I build websites primarily on Webflow and Tilda or custom code, depending on your needs. If you wish to hand-off the project to your own developer, I can provide full design guidelines.</div></div></div></div><h2 id=\"w-node-d814aef7-b4fc-a69b-f6a9-d89824378c08-564b9120\" class=\"heading\">My workflow</h2><p id=\"w-node-_4801f7e7-63cb-c474-cb8e-9727eaf2aaf3-564b9120\" class=\"text-project-description text-margin\">In addition to my design skills, I also have experience in code customisation to fit specific project needs.</p><p id=\"w-node-_95a3b158-449d-d222-2625-d281145b892b-564b9120\" class=\"text-project-description text-margin\">If you&#x27;re looking for a dedicated UX/UI designer who is committed to delivering effective solutions that meet your business needs, I would be thrilled to work with you.<br/><br/></p></div></div></div><div class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"services-list w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"></div></div></div></div></div>",
